    "artifact-worktree": "Three provenance tests correctly reject linked-worktree .git files; reran all tests in clean standalone checkout. Also corrected Android expected export count.",
    "artifact-clean-01": "Source-gate closed count still50, corrected to51 without widening allowlist.",
